Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he took the subway. Yokomon got mad\Nat a baby and nearly gave us all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next the other kids bought\Nfood with our traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money so we had to find a\Nride. Luckily Sora's cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,came by and picked us up\Nhe turned out to be a real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jerk though He accidentally\Nknocked Izzy off a bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Tentomon had to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:02:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Gesomon appeared, and\NTentomon had to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to think, there are people\Nwho do this commute every day.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Raremon! Attack in Tokyo Bay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.21,0:02:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say those little punks\Nbeat Mammothmon and Gesomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon really bungled it\Nwhen she hooked up with those
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nincompoops I guess she's no\Nbetter than the rest of us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think that's funny? Of course not,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boss Then knock off the\Nchatter and find the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eighth child before I\Nlose my patience Aye, aye,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otismon rules! You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Tai, I sure hope that your sister\NKari's over her nasty cold. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time we were here, she remembered\Nwhat had happened four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's possible\Nthat Kari's the eighth child?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Meeko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kari. We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was wrong with Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She took a bit of a fall, that's all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sprained her ankle\Nwhen she was out for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a walk But it's not\Nserious She has to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the hospital for a\Nday And she's hopping
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mad Because it cuts\Ninto her dancing lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, sweet pea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma was worried about your\Ncold And said daddy should
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember your sweater next time\NI feel back to normal now Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you look much better But\Nlet's just check to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel about as cool as a cucumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm back hi Tai why are you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here camp was canceled because
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it snowed snow who would have\Nthought at this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's getting so\Nunpredictable these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought Kari home a present. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your dirty clothes so I can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wash them. Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this all about, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your kids aren't\Nthat bad I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky to have\Na boy like Izzy. He's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the perfect example of\Na gentleman and so smart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my little rascals are always fighting all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time? And never listen\Nto a word I say, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell Billy to get me fed by truck
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stick your tongue\Nout at your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mom. I came home ahead of\Nschedule. Didn't you like camp? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food was inferior
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then it snowed, so\Nthey cancelled everything
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never think about how\NI feel I just wish they
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were still there Sometimes\Nhe's too considerate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why can't I use the\Ndoor? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see you mom i'm going to\Nty's house for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh right now yeah i'm\Nborrowing one of his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reference books i'll\Nbe back in a nanosecond
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a suspicious life form has been spotted in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bay there's\Nspeculation that it is some
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of monster it's\Npossible that it could
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.34,0:06:15.72,Sign,News,0,260,278,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\c&HFDD0B5&}Monsters sighted in Tokyo Bay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be a whale but it seems\Nvery unlikely there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may be some connection\Nbetween this monster
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the giant elephant\Nand bird that attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a nearby town time for sports starting with\Nbaseball i'm back dinner's almost ready
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my parents won't appreciate\Nthis but i think it's imperative
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be in big trouble if my mom and\Ndad came in here and discovered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive that they'd never\Ncomprehend our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know too much about\Nhumans, me being a Digimon and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can tell you one thing for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mom is a really kind lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you don't mind me saying so,\Nshe's not bad looking for a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say I completely\Nagree. She's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,darling one of these days we're\Ngoing to have to tell izzy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the truth about his birth\Ncouldn't we wait just a little
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bit longer i'm afraid that\Nif we tell him now it'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too big of a shock i wouldn't\Nwant it to affect his school
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work but sometimes i wonder\Nif he doesn't sense it he's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smart i have a strange feeling\Nthat he knows he was adopted
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that he's not really our\Nchild why do you think that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dear did he say anything no\Nit's just a mother's intuition
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo, Digimon to Izzy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I kind of zoned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it? Dinner's\Nready. Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have a friend\Nover, he can join us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard someone speaking\Nto you in a funny-sounding voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what I heard? Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was me, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm practicing my new comedy act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're having a talent show\Nat the Children's Center!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the winner could win a new computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who tell jokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why was newton surprised\Nwhen he was hit on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the head by an apple gee\Ni don't know why he was
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sitting under a pear tree what's black and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,white and green two skunks\Nfighting over a pickle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm sorry i guess i'm not\Nvery funny what do you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were hysterical i can't\Nbelieve it's my son my boy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the comedian who would have\Nknown you're a chip off the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,old block and all this time\Ni never knew you had a sense
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of humor bravo izzy that\Nwas a great performance for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your first time you really\Nthink so sure thing don't quit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your day job but you were\Nreally very good that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're absolutely thrilled for\Nyou darling well thanks oh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh mom would you mind at\Nall if i ate the rest of my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dinner in my room don't worry\Ni won't make you eat anything
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you don't want to no\Nmom it's nothing like that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really the way you cook is\Ngastronomically outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate everything you do. Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I believe you're the\Nmost extraordinary mom there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I left the water on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I have some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, this is your third helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since\NI've had such great cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're buttering me up for a raisin\Nallowance, you can just forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is your mom nice and pretty,\Nbut she's an awesome cook. Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that he appreciated us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd be so\Nlucky as to have a son like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about that, honey.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.26,0:09:48.06,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mach-Speed Postal Service
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Tai? You seem bummed.\NUh, I don't know. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're back i missed you when\Nyou were gone i missed you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too by the way carrie do\Nyou remember something that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happened about four years ago\Nin Highton View terrace tell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me everything you know i\Nremember that koromon got
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really huge and fought with a\Nbig bird monster and he beat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him that's something i'll\Nnever forget huh this may sound
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strange but do you have\Nsomething called a digivice kari
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no what's that like this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy Yeah, I am\Ntoo, goodnight Sleep tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sleepyhead Sweet dreams,\Nyou're party poopers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miko, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something below the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding a needle in a haystack, sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's nearby the a-child had better\Nwatch out cause he's a sick duck
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jen and I made some modifications\Nto my computer that are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,truly awesome now this looks\Nintriguing I wonder what it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about another?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very demented.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a map of Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that indicator?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's an unidentified digimon lurking in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bay you're the only\None that's still awake
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hello mrs kamaya this is izzy i was wondering\Nif time might be available to come to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the phone he's sleeping so would you like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me to wake him up no\Ni'm sorry to bother you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's late, but is Sora awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Matt home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call back tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.02,0:13:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I guess everyone's asleep. You\Nshould go to bed too, Izzy. No way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jenna just told me that\Nthere's an unaddened by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon in the bay With\Neveryone sound asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we may have to tackle this Digimon by\Nourselves And I was having such a nice dream
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you up for a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, Izzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but may I suggest I wear a disguise so\NI don't attract any unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's about as\Nrepulsive as they come, that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon is raremon raremon\Nsmells like rotting fish
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.14,0:14:43.15,Sign,Analyzer,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Raremon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.14,0:14:43.15,Sign,Analyzer,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.14,0:14:43.15,Sign,Analyzer,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.14,0:14:43.15,Sign,Analyzer,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Undead Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.14,0:14:43.15,Sign,Analyzer,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.14,0:14:43.15,Sign,Analyzer,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Hedoro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like the inside\Nof a trash can and is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone you never want to\Nmeet in a very dark alley
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, talk about bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we lose that signal, we'll be doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You search for the missing child\Nwhile I take care of old sewer breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope his stink isn't contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have any other choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to Digivolve? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve? I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to wake you,\Nbut Izzy called on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he seemed to be\Nnervous about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:15:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath of me, Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This indicates he's moving. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello? Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you had fun at camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it was cut short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you for loaning\NIzzy that reference book.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, we'd like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's very tired out from camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should let him get a couple of Z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just tiptoe in and check up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door's locked. He's closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should be connecting soon oh don't worry\Ni'm sure there's nothing to be concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about i know you're right but he's acting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,peculiar is he's never\Nlocked the door before
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he is getting older now i guess so but he\Nwas only at camp for half a day i wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happened to make him change so much
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:18:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,signal's gone now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you doing here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parents won't appreciate this,\Nbut I think it's imperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here at the scene\Nof the monster sighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the predator in question\Nseems to have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One wonders if there really\Nwas a monster at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a giant flying cockroach,\Nand I don't think it's friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry you weren't able\Nto find the eighth child,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least we got rid of\Nthat stinking massive blubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been doing some\Nextensive calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My theory is that the eighth\Nchild is located here in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems Kai had the right\Nidea in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get back to his house\Nright now and give him an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.49,0:19:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there no Digimon strong\Nenough to defeat these children?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have to deal with them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should wait\Nuntil morning, Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that exercise made me ultra-hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to be a pig,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you wouldn't happen to have\Nanything to munch on, would you, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you do deserve a nutrition break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go look in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since he got back, he seems\Nlike he's been hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't put my finger on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's keeping something inside, and he\Ndoesn't want to tell us what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he is, you can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we're hiding\Nsomething from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably just a\Nphase he's going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't mean to make them so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they forgive me I'm\Nsure he'll be absolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fine But I'll try to talk\Nsome sense into him No, don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody thinks that he's always\Nperfect But that's too much to expect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of him We've got to give him some\Nfreedom to become his own man You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's got to make mistakes That's part of\Nwhat it is to be a kid Don't you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Izzy was all hyped\Nup about when he called tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Miko?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the eighth child. Gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eighth what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pretty star.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.94,0:21:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the\Nheart. I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you another one.\NI'll be strong for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fly now. I'm going\Nto have the courage. I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To have the heart. I'm going to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.06,0:23:04.98,Sign,,0,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Tokyo Tower Is Hot! DeathMeramon

